      "note_tweet": {
        "text": "Not seeing what tasks it's been assigned is the big one for me too. If you can't watch an agent's plan, you only catch it drifting at the very end. For anyone comparing them on their own work:\n\n\"Act as a UX researcher. I'm testing [agent A] and [agent B] on the same task: [task]. Build a 10-point rubric covering task visibility, interrupting mid-run, threading, inline outputs and error recovery, plus a 20-minute test script to run on both. Rubric table + script.\""
      },
